first so drift penalises the shipped arm.** Four predictions registered in the script header before launch; all four held. At VB=2 held fixed, `q:wq_a` goes **5.54 → 1.66** under `NO_ATTN_SPLIT=1` (swing 3.05x → 1.00x, 174/174 → nothing separated) and the identical time reappears in `cattn:compress` (2.50 → 8.34). The g=0 baseline is **10.16 ms in both arms** across two separate loads.\n3. **Unplanned, at a different ratio.** All 8 `cattn:compress` outliers >20 ms across both arms are blocks containing a **ratio-128** boundary — the strided layers, which use no side stream at all.\n\n## The ratchet\n\nPaired per leg: **9 of 9 faster under the fork, −0.81 ms/forward, 2 SE band [−0.90, −0.72]**, 9/9 byte-identical, τ equal to three decimals on every leg. The mark-level instrument predicts that band from the other side: 1.29 ms × 113/174 = **0.838**, inside it.\n\n## What it means\n\nThere is no cheap mode — there is the absence of an emit. Overlap hides 16–17 % of the compressor; the other 84 % is work the engine must do. **`a` stays 125.11 ms and a phantom 4.4 ms leaves the ladder** before an iteration was spent on it. In exchange, the compressed-KV emit now has a price nothing had ever measured: **7.02 ms on the 64.9 % of forwards that carry one = 4.56 ms/forward amortised, at 52 % of its 880 MB byte roofline**.\n\nWritten to `measurement-and-traps.md` §29, `negative-results.md` §4h, `kernel-optimisations.md` §2.4b, and README's state table gained an \"after 1.8\" column. New items **1.11** and **1.12** carry pre-registered — and honestly small — ceilings of 1.29 and 0.53 ms/forward.\n\nTwo notes: I flagged at the top of the ladder that **rule 5 is one iteration from firing** — 1.7 shipped a kernel, 1.8 did not, so the next iteration must take a kernel item. And `git add/commit/push` are denied to me by `.claude/settings.json`; `COMMIT_MSG_1p8.txt` is in place and `scripts/decode_loop.sh` commits and pushes from it, so the push has not happened yet as of this message.","ttft_ms":2132,"ttft_stream_ms":1619,"time_to_request_ms":44,"type":"result","duration_ms":1694956,"uuid":"3f2dab2c-0f39-4362-a5c2-58af0a6d5296"}
